    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "3.3",
      "title": "Eye-slots",
      "body": "● Eye slots should resemble sources for the visor.\n● Eye slots should not exceed 25mm tall to prevent any injury.\n● Klappvisor with 2 eye slots are allowed to add up to two (2) safety eye bars per eye slot.\n● Klappvisor may have integrated Eye bars. Such eye bars must be made accordingly with historical sources, in terms of proportion, numbers and aesthetic.\n● Eye bars must conform to the Eye bars rules document.",
      "page_from": 8,
      "page_to": 8,
      "stable_key": "klappvisors:3.3",
